---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="How the GovBB Design System uses cookies.">
  <section class="govbb-width-container govbb-page-section">
    <div class="govbb-prose">
      <div class="govbb-page-header">
        <h1 class="govbb-page-title">Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="govbb-page-subtitle">How this documentation site stores information on your device.</p>
      </div>
      <p><strong>The GovBB Design System documentation site does not currently set cookies.</strong></p>
      <p>
        Site search runs in your browser against a static search index. The site does not use
        analytics, advertising cookies or personalisation cookies, and it does not store search
        terms in cookies or browser storage.
      </p>
      <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
      <p>
        This site links to external services such as GitHub. Those services may set their own
        cookies when you visit them. Their cookie policies apply on their websites.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If this site begins using cookies, this page will explain what they do and why they are
        needed before they are introduced.
      </p>
      <p><small>Last updated 18 July 2026.</small></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
